'''Theatre of Blood Veteran''' is an [[Combat Achievements/Elite|elite combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete the [[Theatre of Blood]] 25 times. [[Theatre of Blood/Hard Mode|Hard Mode Theatre of Blood]] completions will also count towards this achievement.

Theatre of Blood: Entry Mode '''does not count''' towards the completion of this achievement.

